{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00053",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 2.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Hi there, come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.28,
      "end_seconds": 6.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Thanks. Sorry, um, I'm a little early."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.16,
      "end_seconds": 10.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Tell me from the beginning, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.72,
      "end_seconds": 21.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "Um, so... a tight band-like headache. That's why I came. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.01,
      "end_seconds": 31.45,
      "duration_seconds": 9.44,
      "text": "Go on. Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.91,
      "end_seconds": 49.3,
      "duration_seconds": 16.39,
      "text": "Yes, stress and long hours on the computer. That makes it worse. A head massage helps a bit. It comes and goes. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. And irritability, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.58,
      "end_seconds": 54.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Any jaw pain when chewing, weakness or vomiting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.31,
      "end_seconds": 60.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "No jaw pain when chewing, weakness or vomiting, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.96,
      "end_seconds": 79.42,
      "duration_seconds": 15.46,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.49,
      "end_seconds": 82.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.32,
      "end_seconds": 85.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Right, what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.47,
      "end_seconds": 89.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.62,
      "end_seconds": 91.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.66,
      "end_seconds": 95.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.22,
      "end_seconds": 99.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.87,
      "end_seconds": 107.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, you know, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.2,
      "end_seconds": 112.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.9,
      "end_seconds": 116.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.87,
      "end_seconds": 123.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.7,
      "end_seconds": 130.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.13,
      "end_seconds": 132.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.7,
      "end_seconds": 141.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "I have anxiety, for two years. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.6,
      "end_seconds": 145.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.74,
      "end_seconds": 151.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Losartan, 50 milligrams, maybe, once a day for my blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.72,
      "end_seconds": 158.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.18,
      "end_seconds": 168.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "Okay, so not with me. I'll bring it next time. I mean, I take paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.91,
      "end_seconds": 172.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.23,
      "end_seconds": 179.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.15,
      "end_seconds": 196.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 77, SpO2 99 percent on room air, blood pressure 114 over 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.97,
      "end_seconds": 200.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I mean, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.06,
      "end_seconds": 219.48,
      "duration_seconds": 18.42,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.94,
      "end_seconds": 222.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.58,
      "end_seconds": 228.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.73,
      "end_seconds": 229.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.32,
      "end_seconds": 233.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.53,
      "end_seconds": 250.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Your eye movements and reflexes are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.93,
      "end_seconds": 252.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.41,
      "end_seconds": 256.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.77,
      "end_seconds": 270.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "The muscles at the back of your neck are tight and tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.6,
      "end_seconds": 272.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.75,
      "end_seconds": 295.74,
      "duration_seconds": 18.99,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Putting it all together, this looks most like a tension-type headache. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'd also keep migraine in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.0,
      "end_seconds": 298.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.3,
      "end_seconds": 315.16,
      "duration_seconds": 14.86,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a tension-type headache is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a tight band-like headache, severe, and no jaw pain when chewing or weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.65,
      "end_seconds": 318.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.79,
      "end_seconds": 327.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "We should do an eye check for headache and eye strain. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.85,
      "end_seconds": 330.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.16,
      "end_seconds": 341.85,
      "duration_seconds": 10.69,
      "text": "I'll start you on amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, for six weeks. It's for headache prevention. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.77,
      "end_seconds": 343.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.3,
      "end_seconds": 354.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.86,
      "text": "Take a break from the screen every hour and do a few neck stretches. Painkillers on most days can actually make the headaches stick around."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.44,
      "end_seconds": 361.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "Okay. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.68,
      "end_seconds": 364.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Mm-hm. I'll also refer you to physiotherapy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.12,
      "end_seconds": 365.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.53,
      "end_seconds": 374.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.88,
      "end_seconds": 376.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.64,
      "end_seconds": 384.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.69,
      "end_seconds": 388.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Got it, um, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.3,
      "end_seconds": 392.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.61,
      "end_seconds": 395.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.85,
      "end_seconds": 402.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.38,
      "end_seconds": 413.3,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "So, uh, I take the amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 414.23,
      "end_seconds": 418.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 420.35,
      "end_seconds": 423.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Okay, so no questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 424.52,
      "end_seconds": 425.37,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}